                    <p class="lead">When you take an <a href=" <?php echo base_url('/'); ?>" target="_self">Instant personal loan</a>, the equated monthly installment is a key factor in deciding the loan amount and tenure. The <a href="https://nowofloan.com/loan/calculator" target="_self">personal loan calculator</a> helps you instantly calculate your pay-outs and, therefore, plan your personal loan and repayment better.</p>
    
